{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1006306-play-by-post-how-to-get-started","id":1006306,"title":"Play by post - How to get started?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-11-21T11:30:19-08:00","id":1006306,"title":"Play by post - How to get started?","content":"Hello,<br /> <br /> I've never played a game by post before and given my current schedule, I'm thinking it might be the best option for gaming right now. How do I get started? Where are the best places to play a CoD game by post? Anything new players should be aware of? Apologies if these questions have already been answered elsewhere.<br /> <br /> Thank you,<br /> <br /> -Rob","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>R. Walker<br /> Creator of Victorian Cut-out Theatre. Writer, punch up artist and promos.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10271-r-walker","name":"R.Walker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-21T12:05:19-08:00","id":1006319,"title":"","content":"For this forum, depends on whether you want to run or play in a game.<br /> <br /> Running a game: Create a recruiting topic in the Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play forum or in the forum of the game you want to play. I've had more luck with the latter, even though I believe it is technically against the rules. <br /> <br /> Playing a game: Either message an ST in an active Play by Post game and see if they have room or wait for someone to start recruiting a game.<br /> <br /> There are other sites, like RPNation, that may be better for Play by Post.","signatur